<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1743902952"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:31.034" ttm:agent="v1000"><div begin="19.110" end="35.671" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v1"><p begin="19.110" end="23.255" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.110" end="20.448">也曾想写封</span><span begin="20.448" end="20.950">信</span><span begin="21.223" end="21.993">给孤独</span><span begin="21.993" end="22.552">的</span><span begin="22.552" end="23.255">夜</span></p><p begin="23.537" end="27.277" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.537" end="24.571">越孤独的</span><span begin="24.571" end="25.011">美</span> <span begin="25.342" end="25.855">越</span><span begin="25.855" end="26.647">刺眼的</span><span begin="26.647" end="27.277">黑</span></p><p begin="27.605" end="31.532" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.605" end="28.678">谁在我的</span><span begin="28.678" end="29.293">世</span><span begin="29.293" end="29.560">界</span><span begin="29.734" end="30.205">交</span><span begin="30.205" end="30.790">换眼</span><span begin="30.790" end="31.532">泪</span></p><p begin="32.071" end="35.671" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.071" end="32.619">乌鸦</span> <span begin="32.619" end="32.884">玫</span><span begin="32.884" end="33.455">瑰</span> <span begin="33.638" end="33.929">我</span><span begin="33.929" end="34.341">都</span><span begin="34.341" end="34.909">奉</span><span begin="34.909" end="35.671">陪</span></p></div><div begin="35.880" end="50.114" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v2"><p begin="35.880" end="39.649" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="35.880" end="36.991">没什麼绝</span><span begin="36.991" end="37.504">对</span> <span begin="37.760" end="38.062">我</span><span begin="38.062" end="38.509">不</span><span begin="38.509" end="39.047">后</span><span begin="39.047" end="39.649">退</span></p><p begin="40.046" end="43.959" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="40.046" end="41.119">天不为谁</span><span begin="41.119" end="41.593">亮</span> <span begin="41.888" end="42.429">也</span><span begin="42.429" end="43.224">不为谁</span><span begin="43.224" end="43.959">灰</span></p><p begin="44.226" end="47.877" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="44.226" end="45.306">没人左右</span><span begin="45.306" end="46.801">我绽放</span><span begin="46.801" end="47.353">或枯</span><span begin="47.353" end="47.877">萎</span></p><p begin="48.039" end="50.114" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="48.039" end="49.417">在路消失之</span><span begin="49.417" end="50.114">前</span></p></div><div begin="50.124" end="1:06.717" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="50.124" end="54.779" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.124" end="50.702">有一</span><span begin="50.702" end="50.923">万</span><span begin="50.923" end="51.270">束</span><span begin="51.481" end="52.999">光</span> <span begin="53.281" end="53.573">你</span><span begin="53.573" end="53.814">给的</span><span begin="53.814" end="54.779">光</span></p><p begin="55.160" end="58.496" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.160" end="55.841">那是</span><span begin="55.841" end="56.403">黑</span><span begin="56.403" end="56.662">夜</span><span begin="56.662" end="57.199">遇见</span><span begin="57.199" end="57.350">的</span><span begin="57.350" end="57.887">太</span><span begin="57.887" end="58.496">阳</span></p><p begin="58.657" end="1:03.024" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="58.657" end="59.270">准备</span><span begin="59.270" end="59.539">好</span><span begin="59.723" end="1:01.213">吗</span> <span begin="1:01.571" end="1:01.798">一</span><span begin="1:01.798" end="1:02.086">往无</span><span begin="1:02.086" end="1:03.024">返</span></p><p begin="1:03.596" end="1:06.717" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:03.596" end="1:04.142">搭上</span><span begin="1:04.142" end="1:04.651">开</span><span begin="1:04.651" end="1:04.904">往</span><span begin="1:04.904" end="1:05.719">旷野的</span><span begin="1:05.719" end="1:06.197">列</span><span begin="1:06.197" end="1:06.717">车</span></p></div><div